# --- AI advisor (Supabase Edge Function secrets) ---
# These are NOT read from this file or the frontend. Set them on the function with:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... [ANTHROPIC_MODEL=...]
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=        (required, secret, never commit)
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5   (optional; the default lives in supabase/functions/_shared/advisor/config.ts)
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=medium           (optional: low | medium | high | xhigh | max)
# ANTHROPIC_FALLBACKS=on            (optional: set to "off" to disable server-side refusal fallbacks)
